<BaseLayout title="Terms"><div class="page-wrap prose"><span class="eyebrow">TERMS / PRE-LAUNCH DRAFT</span><h1>Clear terms.<br />Considered routes.</h1><div class="notice">Not a final legal agreement. Operator details, refund policy, usage allowance, and applicable legal terms must be completed and reviewed before accepting payments.</div><h2>What Zusal provides</h2><p>Zusal provides model selection for supported coding-agent harnesses. Harnesses own execution-provider credentials, model calls, tools, and conversation behavior. Compatibility is defined by verified releases, not by launch targets alone.</p><h2>Pro subscriptions</h2><p>Pro is $5 per month or $50 paid upfront per year, with the same features. Execution-model usage is billed separately by your model providers. Applicable checkout taxes are shown by the billing provider.</p><h2>Free access</h2><p>The first 1,000 qualifying activations receive 30 days; subsequent eligible accounts receive 14 days. Free access starts on the first successful real routed model request, not signup or device pairing. No card is required. An explicit subscription is required to continue routing afterward.</p><h2>Renewal and cancellation</h2><p>Paid subscriptions renew at the chosen interval. Cancellation stops the next renewal and retains routing through the current paid period. Failed paid renewal has a three-day grace period. Dashboard and history remain available within retention limits after routing access ends.</p><h2>Deletion and refunds</h2><p>Account deletion ends access immediately, revokes connected devices, cancels future renewals, and removes usage/profile data. Deletion or cancellation does not itself promise an automatic or prorated refund. Refund terms remain a launch dependency and do not override applicable mandatory rights.</p><h2>Usage and accuracy</h2><p>Routing quality, response quality, provider availability, latency, and savings are not guaranteed. Cost figures are estimates, not provider invoices. Usage limits will be published before paid launch; unlimited use is not promised.</p><h2>Service readiness</h2><p>This site is an implementation preview until production services, approved checkout, real release downloads, and final policies are configured. Preview interactions do not create paid subscriptions.</p></div></BaseLayout>
